(borge-bug (id "BORGE-1788068865")
  (title "borge.borg inlines a nonexistent lib.borg — borge inline/report hard-fail on borge's own repo. Root borge.borg ends its inline list with (inline \"lib.borg\") but no root lib.borg exists (docs/architecture.borg:271 documents the mismatch). Repro: borge inline . -> 'Error: file not found: ./docs/lib.borg'... note the path says docs/ because the quoted target resolves against the parent dir; either way the target is missing. borge book print now degrades (lone-chapter warning) after the inline-aware walk (94c4aa4), but inline/report still abort. Fix: restore/drop the lib.borg target (or point it at docs/architecture.borg which indexes the lib dirs).")
  (status open)
  (created 2026-08-29)
  (filed-by roerick)
  (doc "")
)
